WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.698 --> 00:00:11.800
Once upon a time, there lived a king with a beautiful daughter.

2
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.602
She liked to play with her golden ball by the pond near the forest.

3
00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:20.105
One day the princess accidentally let the ball fall into the pond.

4
00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:22.327
Splash! "Oops!

5
00:00:23.007 --> 00:00:23.608
Oh no!"

6
00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:24.868
she cried.

7
00:00:25.449 --> 00:00:29.151
She tried to find her ball in the pond, but the water was too deep.

8
00:00:31.388 --> 00:00:33.509
The princess began to cry very loudly.

9
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:37.051
An ugly frog sitting on a rock by the pond heard her.

10
00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:41.494
"Boo-hoo-hoo! Now what will I do?

11
00:00:41.514 --> 00:00:44.235
I have lost my golden ball forever!"

12
00:00:44.756 --> 00:00:45.236
she said.

13
00:00:45.856 --> 00:00:47.657
"What is the matter, princess?

14
00:00:48.177 --> 00:00:49.578
Why are you crying?"

15
00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:51.159
the frog asked.

16
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.022
"I am crying because my golden ball fell into the pond," she answered.

17
00:00:57.042 --> 00:00:59.724
"Do not cry.

18
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.201
I can help you!"

19
00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:02.461
said the frog.

20
00:01:02.481 --> 00:01:05.462
"How can this ugly frog help me?"

21
00:01:06.063 --> 00:01:07.163
the princess wondered.

22
00:01:07.743 --> 00:01:09.084
The ugly frog paused.

23
00:01:09.104 --> 00:01:14.446
"Hmm. What will you give me for finding your golden ball?"

24
00:01:14.927 --> 00:01:15.487
he asked.

25
00:01:15.507 --> 00:01:21.490
"I will give you whatever you want, dear frog," the princess promised.

26
00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:23.310
"I will give you my jewels.

27
00:01:23.911 --> 00:01:26.492
I will even give you the golden crown I am wearing."

28
00:01:28.076 --> 00:01:32.677
"I do not want your jewels or your crown," answered the frog.

29
00:01:32.697 --> 00:01:39.499
"But promise me this: take me back to the castle and let me sit by you and eat

30
00:01:39.559 --> 00:01:40.039
with you.

31
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.240
And you must kiss me too.

32
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.400
Promise me!

33
00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:48.602
Then I will go down into the pond and get your ball."

34
00:01:48.622 --> 00:01:51.382
"Oh, if I must, yes!

35
00:01:51.782 --> 00:01:55.143
I promise you all that you wish," the princess consented.

36
00:01:55.163 --> 00:01:57.204
"Now please hurry!"

37
00:01:57.824 --> 00:02:00.966
So the frog hopped into the pond and retrieved the golden ball.

38
00:02:01.886 --> 00:02:03.287
He tossed it onto the grass.

39
00:02:03.947 --> 00:02:05.528
The princess was very happy.

40
00:02:05.548 --> 00:02:08.050
"Oh, my golden ball!

41
00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.270
Thank you, frog!"

42
00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:10.171
she said.

43
00:02:10.751 --> 00:02:12.692
She picked up the ball and hurried away.

44
00:02:12.712 --> 00:02:14.673
"Wait, wait!"

45
00:02:15.013 --> 00:02:15.794
called the frog.

46
00:02:15.814 --> 00:02:17.375
"Take me with you!

47
00:02:17.795 --> 00:02:20.076
I cannot run as fast as you can."

48
00:02:23.058 --> 00:02:26.860
But the princess ignored him and hurried back to her castle and closed the door.

49
00:02:27.468 --> 00:02:29.129
"The frog is talking nonsense.

50
00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:31.770
The forest is the right place for a frog.

51
00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:34.211
Life in the castle is not for him!"

52
00:02:34.751 --> 00:02:35.792
she said to herself.

53
00:02:36.392 --> 00:02:39.513
The next day the frog hopped up to the castle door and knocked.

54
00:02:40.113 --> 00:02:41.514
"Oh, princess!

55
00:02:41.814 --> 00:02:45.316
Princess! Open the door for me."

56
00:02:49.817 --> 00:02:52.178
no! It is the ugly frog!

57
00:02:52.719 --> 00:02:53.799
Make him go away!"

58
00:02:54.259 --> 00:02:55.720
the princess told her servant.

59
00:02:56.336 --> 00:02:59.297
The servant went to the door and told the frog to leave immediately.

60
00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:04.138
She slammed the door in the poor frog's face, but the frog did not go away.

61
00:03:04.158 --> 00:03:06.799
"Princess, princess!

62
00:03:07.519 --> 00:03:08.959
Open the door for me.

63
00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.780
Keep the promise you made to me.

64
00:03:13.341 --> 00:03:19.562
If you don't open the door, I will cry here day and night until you do!

65
00:03:20.483 --> 00:03:21.983
Open the door!"

66
00:03:22.643 --> 00:03:25.544
The king noticed that his daughter was bothered by something.

67
00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.822
"My child, what are you afraid of?

68
00:03:29.503 --> 00:03:31.825
Is there something scary outside?"

69
00:03:32.325 --> 00:03:32.866
he asked.

70
00:03:32.886 --> 00:03:35.888
"No, it is nothing," she answered.

71
00:03:35.908 --> 00:03:38.230
"It is only a disgusting frog!"

72
00:03:40.332 --> 00:03:42.734
She then told her father how the frog had helped her.

73
00:03:42.754 --> 00:03:47.177
"Dear child, you must keep your promise to the frog.

74
00:03:47.818 --> 00:03:49.519
A promise is a promise.

75
00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.361
Go and let him in!"

76
00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:54.924
So the princess let him in, and they all sat down to eat.

77
00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:01.683
"Lift me up beside you, princess," the frog asked, but the princess didn't want to.

78
00:04:01.703 --> 00:04:07.805
"Dear, a promise is a promise," said the king.

79
00:04:07.825 --> 00:04:12.287
"You should not make a promise if you do not intend to keep it."

80
00:04:12.927 --> 00:04:17.629
The princess did not want the frog near her, but she could not disobey her father.

81
00:04:18.209 --> 00:04:20.270
So she let the frog hop up beside her.

82
00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:24.452
"Now push your golden plate nearer to me.

83
00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:29.702
I am hungry and I want to eat with you," the frog said.

84
00:04:31.183 --> 00:04:36.505
The frog enjoyed all of the food, but the princess had no appetite because she did not like

85
00:04:36.545 --> 00:04:38.085
being near the ugly frog.

86
00:04:38.746 --> 00:04:43.688
After dinner the princess went to her room, but the frog insisted on following her.

87
00:04:44.748 --> 00:04:47.169
When she closed the door, he made his last demand.

88
00:04:47.189 --> 00:04:51.051
"Dear princess, it is time for you to kiss me!

89
00:04:51.671 --> 00:04:54.272
If you do not, I will tell your father!"

90
00:04:54.932 --> 00:04:57.293
"Oh! Nooo!"

91
00:04:58.293 --> 00:04:59.553
the princess protested.

92
00:05:00.774 --> 00:05:03.134
She grabbed the frog and threw him against the wall.

93
00:05:03.154 --> 00:05:06.335
"Now you will be quiet, you ugly frog!"

94
00:05:06.996 --> 00:05:09.176
"Ohh!" groaned the frog.

95
00:05:09.736 --> 00:05:11.037
Then it was very still.

96
00:05:11.717 --> 00:05:14.018
The princess quickly regretted what she had done.

97
00:05:14.038 --> 00:05:16.398
"Oh, is he dead?

98
00:05:17.218 --> 00:05:19.359
Oh my, what have I done!"

99
00:05:20.099 --> 00:05:24.729
She picked up the ugly frog very tenderly, but the frog still did not move.

100
00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:27.351
The princess felt very sorry for him.

101
00:05:27.371 --> 00:05:32.534
"He just wanted to be my friend.

102
00:05:33.095 --> 00:05:35.016
What have I done to this poor frog?"

103
00:05:35.556 --> 00:05:36.017
she said.

104
00:05:36.637 --> 00:05:38.498
And she kissed the frog as she cried.

105
00:05:39.139 --> 00:05:44.322
Suddenly with a bright flash of light, the ugly frog transformed into a handsome prince.

106
00:05:44.342 --> 00:05:46.944
"Wow! You broke the spell!"

107
00:05:47.364 --> 00:05:47.805
he said.

108
00:05:47.825 --> 00:05:53.861
"A long time ago, a wicked witch turned me into an ugly frog just because I did not

109
00:05:53.921 --> 00:05:54.281
like her.

110
00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:58.263
Only the kiss of a beautiful princess could save me.

111
00:05:58.823 --> 00:05:59.944
Thank you, dear princess!"

112
00:06:00.604 --> 00:06:02.785
The princess was overjoyed at the change.

113
00:06:03.345 --> 00:06:07.468
In no time at all, the prince and the princess fell in love and were married.

114
00:06:07.988 --> 00:06:09.669
And they lived happily ever after.
